  "notable_quotes": [
    "Zn-ATA combines IAST selectivities of about 2 for both C2H6/C2H4 and C2H2/C2H4, outperforming state-of-the-art materials.",
    "A prior synergistic packed-bed sorbent approach produced only 0.32 mmol g−1 C2H4 per cycle, indicating modest productivity.",
    "Kinetic and molecular-sieving materials are inadequate for ternary C2 separation because they preferentially adsorb C2H4 over C2H6."
